@startuml
title WINDOWED semantic window

[*] --> WindowActive : first acquire
WindowActive --> WindowActive : duplicate access\nFIXED: unchanged\nSLIDING: extend window
WindowActive --> WindowExpired : now >= windowExpireAt
WindowExpired --> NewGeneration : next execute()
NewGeneration --> WindowActive : version + 1

note right of WindowExpired
Physical record may still exist during recordRetentionTtl.
Semantic idempotency protection has ended.
end note
@enduml
